"P3098773102" "You have the information you seek."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3628547108" "It's not much, {HeroName}, but it's a start. I commend you. With this list, we're one step closer to exposing the Nictus alliance. Now, if only we had the decryption key!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3211430897" "I hear {HeroName} knows more about the Council than just about anyone!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1534859578" "That encrypted list you found looks like it contains a lot of information. The only trouble is, we can't read it. I'm going to have to send you in to another of Requiem's bases. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If we don't find some kind of decryption key, this information you found will be useless forever.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P1536244799" "Find a decryption key"
// SendOffString :
"P422625289" "If the Council knows what we're looking for, they're likely to alter or destroy the decryption key. So you had better arrest every villain in the place, to keep them guessing about our true intent."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3562925072" "Defeat all villains in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P278297431" "Have you found anything yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3870528529" "An alarm sounds. Security has definitely been tightened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2120144748" "After defeating the villains, you found a note in your pocket."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2296031874" "You didn't get the decryption key, but that note you found may well lead us to it. If we can believe this Adjutant Lanney, he has potent information about his masters. Now, we have to get to him before the Council does!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2222938303" "{HeroName} sure has it in for the Council!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2257868359" "I don't know whether we can trust this Adjutant Lanney, but his offer of information is the best lead we have. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to meet with this defector and see what information he can offer us.</a> But be wary, {HeroName}. If the Council has learned of his plans, they will certainly come after him."
// AcceptString :
"P2300806576" "Meet with the defector"
// SendOffString :
"P4160538881" "Adjutant Lanney asked that you meet him at the old Gallatin Investments office. You had better hurry."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2729374964" "Find Adjutant Lanney"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1916308089" "Have you found Adjutant Lanney yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1394863584" "The moment you step through the door you know something is wrong. The Council is already here!"

