// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Note 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1669434120" "Strange painting"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1118230984" "This painting doesn't seem to belong here."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3645415031" "You have peeled the painting off the canvas."
// InteractActionString :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2511753163" "Under the false painting, you found a note from Adjutant Lanney."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1515347341" "You were too late to save Adjutant Lanney, but at least you found his last message to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2155623523" "Did you say Lillian? Lillian's been kidnapped? This is terrible! We can't abandon our mission, {HeroName}. But one thing is certain: I won't see Lillian Issan fall victim to the Council!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2749411035" "Shadowstar's looking mighty worried lately. Something about her daughter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2166064326" "Lillian's been kidnapped. Requiem and Arakhn are conspiring. We still don't have proof of their activities, and a man lost his life trying to help us! I'm glad I have you to rely on in a time like this, {HeroName}. Fortunately, Adjutant Lanney left us a clue to Lillian's location before the Council disposed of him. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If we can get her back safe and sound, we can concentrate on exposing the Nictus Alliance.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P183278561" "Get Lillian back"
// SendOffString :
"P3157983864" "According to Lanney's note, Arakhn is having Lillian moved to a secret lab for experimentation. I don't mind telling you, I'm deeply concerned for her. If we don't get her back safely, I'm not sure I'll be able to live with myself."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P916525261" "Find Lillian Issan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P552935038" "We need Lillian back, {HeroName}. Tell me, what have you learned?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3595849066" "This underground lab contains all the equipment Arakhn will need to continue her ghastly Nictus fragment experiments."

