// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1567273855" "We may have to keep moving Issan. {HeroName} isn't the only one interested in her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P325767450" "You will never find the reporter!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4263083632" "You didn't find Lillian, but at least she managed to get the decryption key to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3451312523" "That Lillian. Well, I've got to hand it to her: the girl has spirit. The decryption key she left should give us everything we need to translate that list of bases that are part of the Nictus alliance. We're one step closer to exposing Requiem and Arakhn, thanks to her."
// RandomFameString :
"P2083116246" "{HeroName}'s hot on the trail of that reporter, Lillian Issan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1909301970" "I've run that list you found through the decryption program Lillian left for us. {HeroName}, the amount of information on that list is staggering! Bases that are part of the Nictus alliance. Front companies for Requiem's financial dealings. Sources for Arakhn's scientific equipment. The list goes on and on! This is exactly the sort of proof we've been looking for, {HeroName}. But there's one more thing for you to do. <br><br>According to this list, Requiem kept a lot of his personal mail at a front company called Frontline Securities. It seems he didn't fully trust Arakhn, and he wanted to keep a record of their dealings in case she one day betrayed him. Once we expose this list, I'm sure Requiem will crash the place. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>So if we're to ever get our hands on that data, we have to do it now.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3912089150" "Get the data"
// SendOffString :
"P4258301987" "The information at that front company could tell us a lot about the recent activities of the Nictus. It may even tell us where Lillian's been taken!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P960409148" "Defeat all at front company"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P468291403" "We need to investigate that front company before Requiem has a chance to crash it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1267937998" "The place is in a flurry of activity. It appears Requiem has already learned of your investigations."

